환사채포함)발행후만기전사채취득","date":"2023-11-28","url":"https://dart.fss.or.kr/dsaf001/main.do?rcpNo=20231128900204"},{"id":"D25","kind":"DART 공시","title":"전환사채(해외전환사채포함)발행후만기전사채취득","date":"2023-11-28","url":"https://dart.fss.or.kr/dsaf001/main.do?rcpNo=20231128900203"},{"id":"D26","kind":"DART 공시","title":"전환사채(해외전환사채포함)발행후만기전사채취득","date":"2023-09-27","url":"https://dart.fss.or.kr/dsaf001/main.do?rcpNo=20230927900574"},{"id":"D27","kind":"DART 공시","title":"전환사채(해외전환사채포함)발행후만기전사채취득","date":"2023-09-27","url":"https://dart.fss.or.kr/dsaf001/main.do?rcpNo=20230927900572"},{"id":"D28","kind":"DART 공시","title":"매출액또는손익구조30%(대규모법인은15%)이상변동","date":"2023-03-07","url":"https://dart.fss.or.kr/dsaf001/main.do?rcpNo=20230307900154"},{"id":"D29","kind":"DART 공시","title":"소송등의제기ㆍ신청(경영권분쟁소송)(주주명부 열람 및 등사 가처분)","date":"2023-02-27","url":"https://dart.fss.or.kr/dsaf001/main.do?rcpNo=20230227900190"},{"id":"R","kind":"DART 사업보고서","title":"사업보고서 (2024.12) 'II. 사업의 내용'","date":"2025-03-17","url":"https://dart.fss.or.kr/dsaf001/main.do?rcpNo=20250317000709"}]}